    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Forbes Property is delighted to present No. 3 Block A, Bow Bridge Place to the market. Positioned in a highly desirable, secure gated development, this beautiful two-bedroom apartment offers a perfect blend of space, exceptional natural light, and modern convenience.\n\nPresented in immaculate condition throughout, this clean, bright home is ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a turnkey property in one of Dublin's most vibrant neighbourhoods.\n\nKey Features:\nLight-Filled Interiors: Bright and spacious living area bathed in natural light.\n\nImmaculate Condition: Beautifully maintained, spotlessly clean, and ready for immediate occupation.\n\nSecure Parking: Includes secure parking within the gated development.\n\nTwo Generous Bedrooms: Both bedrooms feature fitted wardrobes and excellent proportions.\n\nPrime Location: Situated right beside Heuston Quarter, offering immediate access to transport, shopping, and dining.\n\nGreen Spaces On Your Doorstep: Minutes from the Irish National War Memorial Gardens and Phoenix Park.\n\nUnbeatable Connectivity: Moments from Heuston Station, the Luas Red Line, direct bus routes, and an easy stroll into Dublin City Centre.\n\nDescription:\nAccommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with storage, a spacious and airy living/dining room flooded with natural light, a fully equipped modern kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a main bathroom.\n\nThe location is second to none. Nestled off Bow Lane West, Bow Bridge Place combines quiet, gated residential living with immediate proximity to the city's key hubs. You are just steps from Heuston Quarter, local cafes, and amenities. For outdoor enthusiasts, the tranquil Irish National War Memorial Gardens and Phoenix Park are right nearby, while Dublin City Centre is just a short walk or Luas ride away.\n\nAccommodation:\nEntrance Hall: Built-in storage closet, intercom, quality flooring.\n\nLiving / Dining Area: Exceptionally bright, light-filled living space with large windows.\n\nKitchen: Modern fitted kitchen with ample storage and counter space.\n\nBedroom 1: Spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2: Generous bedroom with built-in storage.\n\nBathroom: Clean, modern three-piece suite.\n\nViewing is highly recommended. Contact Forbes Property today to arrange an appointment."
      },
